{"message":"Hi! The contact importer matches columns by header name, not by position, so the order of your columns doesn’t matter as long as the headers match. The required headers are **email**, **name** and **company**. Optional headers include **phone**, **title** and any custom field that already exists in your workspace – just use the custom field’s own name. Any header the importer doesn’t recognise will be ignored, so an extra column won’t block the import.

If you want to be 100 % sure, download the sample template from the import screen – it shows the exact header spelling the importer expects. Also, exporting as CSV is the safest default for compatibility, though it will treat dates and numbers as plain text.

